 "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple :  J'adore ce mec.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le coin", "type": "name"}, {"content": "entre deux rues", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'habite au coin de la rue du Temple et de la rue de Lille.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\u00e0 plus", "type": "name"}, {"content": "expression pour dire \u00e0 tout \u00e0 l'heure", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(locution)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ok, \u00e0 plus. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Dessinez un plan de votre quartier (Placez-y 10 endroits).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez 5 phrases d\u00e9crivant l'emplacement de 5 endroits sur votre plan.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Utilisez une pr\u00e9position pour chaque phrase.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Utilisez au minimum 3 mots de la section \"mots-cl\u00e9s\".", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "J'\u00e9cris 5 phrases.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je parle de l'emplacement de diff\u00e9rents endroits.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'utilise des mots de cette le\u00e7on.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "frn2le01ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn2le01ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Bonjour ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Salut Charlotte ! Est-ce que c'est ton anniversaire ce soir ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "4500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Oui, c'est ce soir. C'est \u00e0 Sushi Ya, un restaurant japonais. <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Mmmm ! \u00a0J'adore les sushis ! O\u00f9 se trouve ce restaurant ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "13000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Rue du chemin Vert.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Combien co\u00fbte le d\u00eener ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Ce n'est pas trop cher. Le d\u00eener co\u00fbte environ 12 euros par personne. Et les desserts sont d\u00e9licieux."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "23500", "id": 4, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Quelle est l'adresse ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : L'adresse est 64, rue du chemin Vert. \u00a0C-H-E-M-I-N."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "31250", "id": 5, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : O\u00f9 est le restaurant ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Ce n'est pas loin d'ici. Descends l'avenue de la R\u00e9publique. Tourne \u00e0 droite. Ensuite va tout droit jusqu'\u00e0  la rue du Chemin Vert. Le restaurant se trouve juste au coin."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob11re2img01.jpg", "time": "44250", "id": 6, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Ah oui. Je rencontre mon ami dans cette rue, \u00e0 un caf\u00e9 proche de ce restaurant tous les jours.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Ton ami Ted ? \u00a0Le grand mec aux cheveux marron ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob11re2img01.jpg", "time": "54500", "id": 7, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Ouais, il est de Bretagne. <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Il est mignon ! Est-ce que tu pourras me le pr\u00e9senter un jour ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "60500", "id": 8, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Sans probl\u00e8me ! \u00a0Bon, je te vois \u00e0 7 heures ce soir !<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : \u00c0 plus !"}], "audiosrc": "frn2le01ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le01ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "frn2le01ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le01ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Je peux partager des informations personnelles.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux construire des phrases affirmatives et n\u00e9gatives.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux demander et dire o\u00f9 sont les endroits dans un quartier. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Quel type de cuisine aimes-tu ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Quel est ton restaurant pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9 ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "O\u00f9 est-il situ\u00e9 ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Je peux demander et dire comment vont les gens.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Coin r\u00e9vision.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids":